{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_008_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:603dc51ea5fcabdc918a767be060babb0d55fdb3cd63e6654224f9829c9292a3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1fc4c431e5127e42089bf73ea4beb829939c930f489142fd43b8b0498434448",
      "text": "好了，比赛终于进入尾声！\n冲过最后的弯道，领跑的是9号！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6200d78e6d60237b41e0fa91245efeeecb5b4a20b5fa0f1a71cff4b848f8f53a",
      "text": "（丽先生预测的两匹马还在后方。\n接下来会怎么样呢……真紧张啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a56e644e2d09bb4801ca03c2617f1d079943493699aac3f84b1edbff902e4d33",
      "text": "……啊，丽先生，冲上来了！无限梦想和\n弦乐二重奏追上来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:639bf54e122f6581f840c8ffd4816bae022882cfd7b669f22f12527b4f6ab1d2",
      "text": "嗯。两匹马的奔跑都充满力量！\n不断超越周围的马匹……简直如同一阵风啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b986835d15ccdeaad61d99c44a9882cefd97f0152be33c656b8c069faa0baabd",
      "text": "（在终点线前激烈争夺……！真没想到\n能看到如此热烈的较量）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e697be2725233bac6f6f6cac5dc5acc5233776b0c005e664d7f1e67350c8d0e",
      "text": "（在草地上奋力驰骋的光芒。\n让人移不开视线的疾驰绝非人力所能及……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b20be2743db0a4d400cca69917340ef4b88d995bcd6021f35fa36fb00c3708b",
      "text": "3号、15号，同时冲线！这可……\n很难判定呢。将进行终点摄影判定。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23d9a342ebf848b8006a3d649574eeea1acc896cd31403ceff1f222d170ce56f",
      "text": "到底是哪边赢了呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aeb907dc29442b3e138a23794efd722e986cac3030c417e21807c87c6f595514",
      "text": "不得而知啊。唯一可以确定的是双方都拼尽了全力。\n现在，静候判定结果吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d9542b3b37dc28aa8646419ef67ef74fd479df9d638cc591ff403671f1bca9a",
      "text": "……结果出来了！经判定，无限梦想、\n弦乐二重奏……并列第1名！并列第1名！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da9e4ff3b9afc6053b58ccbe659af1902e60d0ec9ee15ae944ee98298791143b",
      "text": "太厉害了，\n丽先生的预测完全说中了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2987a41f6fcc20a688135f57dab13c05793b87b306c361bdc63869512b955e71",
      "text": "嗯。以它们的实力，这个结果理所应当。恭喜你们，\n无限梦想、弦乐二重奏！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
